          "id": "derive-1-1",
          "claim": "Let $P(N)$ mean that the endpoint after $N$ admitted operations lies in $D_+$. For $N=0$, the endpoint is the stipulated $T_{\\mathrm{in}}>0$, so $P(0)$ holds.",
          "step": "1.1",
