          "id": "derive-2-1",
          "claim": "Assume $P(N)$ [IH]. The stipulated operation sends its current temperature $T_N\\in(0,T_*]$ to $rT_N$; because $0<r<1$, $0<rT_N<T_N\\le T_*$, so the next endpoint satisfies $P(N+1)$. This uses the positive-temperature coordinate on the declared chart.",
          "step": "2.1",
